.TH KANBAN-APPLET 1 "September 2026" "kan-bone-rs 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kanban-applet \- COSMIC panel applet for adding Kanban cards
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kanban-applet
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kanban-applet
provides the KanBone COSMIC panel integration for adding a card without
leaving the current window. It is normally started by cosmic-panel rather
than directly by the user.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kanban-app (1)
